        <briefdescription>
<para>Size - Size of the basic block in bytes. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>If the block contains inline assembly, this is a worst case estimate.</para>
<para>The size does not include any alignment padding whether from the beginning of the block, or from an aligned jump table at the end. </para>
